                        </div>
                        <div id="blog-1" class="endpoint-body" :style="{display: isEndpointOpen['blog-1'] ? 'block' : 'none'}">
                            <p><strong>Endpoint:</strong> <%= globals.port_base_url %>api/user/blog</p>
                            <p><strong>Description:</strong> Create a new blog post</p>
                            
                            <div class="alert-box alert-mandatory">
                                <strong>Request Body (JSON):</strong>
                                <div class="code-block">{
    "title" : "AI",
    "slug" : "Artifical Intelligence",
    "content" : "Lorem ipsum dolor sit, amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Sapiente, blanditiis earum praesentium quos deserunt quidem repellendus expedita facilis. Ipsa possimus dicta minus laudantium tempora, consequuntur quasi vitae laboriosam minima asperiores consequatur nihil aliquam soluta sequi magni! Consequatur vitae mollitia repudiandae voluptatibus possimus animi laudantium.",
