                            <h4>Response Status</h4>
                            <ul>
                                <li><strong>HTTP 200</strong> - code: 1 - Blog created successfully</li>
                                <li><strong>HTTP 200</strong> - code: 0 - Blog creation failed</li>
                                <li><strong>HTTP 400</strong> - Bad Request (missing title or content)</li>
                                <li><strong>HTTP 401</strong> - Unauthorized (invalid/missing token)</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
